cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this course, its PDFs, figures, or code, please cite this repository and the third-party resources listed in NOTICE.md."
title: "Ultrasound Beamforming Learning: Chinese Course Notes and MATLAB Labs"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-14
authors:
  - name: "Ultrasound Beamforming Learning contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ajairDD/Ultrasound_Beamforming_Learning"
url: "https://github.com/ajairDD/Ultrasound_Beamforming_Learning"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  A Chinese-language course on medical ultrasound beamforming, from delay-and-sum
  fundamentals through CF/GCF, MVDR, DMAS/fDMAS, SLSC, NSI, benchmarking, and a
  shared RTB comparison. The repository includes chapter PDFs, MATLAB teaching
  code, figure provenance, and reproducible PDF build notes. Code is licensed
  under AGPL-3.0-only; course text, PDFs, and original figures are licensed under
  CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Third-party datasets and software retain their own terms.
keywords:
  - ultrasound
  - beamforming
  - delay-and-sum
  - MATLAB
  - USTB
  - medical imaging
  - education
